WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.500
Narrator: Now Noura.

2
00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.800
Narrator: She looks, she asks, she walks fifteen metres away.

3
00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:07.900
Noura: Is this yours?

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Kiosk Staff: No.

5
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.000
Narrator: Then a calm, clear call.

6
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.300
Noura: Sierra 2, Sierra 2, this is Marshal 22, over.

7
00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:22.400
Sierra 2: Go ahead, over.

8
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:36.800
Noura: Item of Interest. Concourse level 1, behind Kiosk 7. Sports bag, taped, pushed under the counter. Nobody claims it. Kiosk staff saw a man leave it ten minutes ago. I'm behind the pillar by Kiosk 6, stopping people approaching. Over.

9
00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:41.200
Sierra 2: Received. Security on the way. Keep people back from the kiosk. Over.

